title: Event metadata
id: protocol-event-metadata
order: 1
description: "What a custom AG-UI server must put in metadata.tanstack so TanStack ChatClient and useChat get finishReason, model, and leftover usage."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - ag-ui protocol
  - metadata.tanstack
  - finishReason
  - custom server
  - SSE
